file tools/fixtures/u/unheard_guard_scan.sh the second population, the wide closure, four new readings, the self-exclusion, and both closures made incremental
file tools/fixtures/u/unheard_guard_control.sh five new pens, 27 behaviors to 52, every new refusal shown from both sides
file tools/u/unheard_guard_witness.rish the third ceiling pinned, the new legs named, and the header molted A/88 under a cairn
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri the roster comment carries the widening, the measured 21s, and why unnamed_runners is reported rather than gated
file construction/REDS.md %465 CLOSED with its repair and its declined triage; %486 booked and closed
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md two cairns -- the witness header molt, and the card fold
file construction/ITINERARY.md the round's block on the live front, and the git nib
recommend keep-going -- the next mechanical lap in this lane is the 408 runners' EFFECT reading, which this census names and refuses to guess at: a meter that answers which runners may be put on a clock by what a program touches rather than by what it is called. It is the instrument the triage wanted and it wants its own round, since it must be conservative toward actor and prove that conservatism on a pen.
